    },
    {
      "displayText": "看到是自己喜歡的，\n就來伸手搶別人的食物……<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n有隻野生的電飛鼠搞得我頭痛得要命。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƊ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 304,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "770B5230662F81EA5DF1559C6B617684FF0C000A5C314F864F38624B643652254EBA768498DF72692026202600100001BE00000A670996BB91CE751F768496FB98DB9F20641E5F976211982D75DB5F978981547D3002001000020114018A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 48
    },
    {
      "displayText": "而且那傢伙逃得又特別快，\n大夥兒都吃過牠的癟咧。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƊ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 400,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "800C4E1490A350A24F1990035F9753C8727952255FEBFF0C000A59275925515290FD5403904E72607684765F54A73002001000020114018A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我說<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳……\n<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳在ZA登峰戰也是出名的強吧。<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n狠狠地秀一下<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳的厲害，\n讓那隻電飛鼠收斂點好不好。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƊ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 10,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 460,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62118AAA00100003110000FF01014F6059B320262026000A00100003110000FF01014F6059B35728005A0041767B5CF062304E5F662F51FA540D76845F375427300200100001BE01000A72E072E0573079C04E004E0B00100003110000FF01014F6059B3768453B25BB3FF0C000A8B9390A396BB96FB98DB9F20653665829EDE597D4E0D597D3002001000020114018A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 73
    },
    {
      "displayText": "要打倒牠還是要捉住牠，\n都隨<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳的便。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƊ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 608,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "89816253501272609084662F898163494F4F7260FF0C000A90FD96A800100003110000FF01014F6059B376844FBF3002001000020114018A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "對了，那隻扒手電飛鼠\n最愛的是桃桃果。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƊ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 668,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5C0D4E86FF0C90A396BB6252624B96FB98DB9F20000A6700611B7684662F68436843679C3002001000020114018A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "嗯淘淘！！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 716,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "55EF6DD86DD8FF01FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 6
    },
    {
      "displayText": "話才剛說完，\n我的桃桃果就被牠搶走了！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƊ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
