      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "幫我去追那隻電飛鼠吧！\n用洛托姆滑翔應該就可以追上。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƊ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
